*-backups/
*.kicad_pcb-bak
*.kicad_sch-bak
_autosave-*
*.lck
~*.lck
fp-info-cache
# Design-tool working/backup output (renders/reports/backups — generated, not shipped)
hardware/mdx1/build/

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# ── Third-party vendor datasheets (component PDFs — not ours to redistribute) ──
docs/datasheets/

# ── Personal distributor shopping-cart exports (contain name / account data) ──
**/*Cart*.pdf

